Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.04,0:02:52.04,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,765)\blur3\bord6\fs180\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&}Excalibur
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack batter, it's changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp! Oh my god. Kazuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only three clear spots left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you use that skill\Nconnector thingy you used before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still got two bars\Nleft on his HP gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skill connect won't even put a dent in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice breath coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the buffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazard, don't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep him busy for a few!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsman, if we continue this course\Nof action, we will not defeat Thrym.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is but one hope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in this room,\Nhidden in the plunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will find the treasure\Nof my people. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it looks\Nlike and I'll grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is about yea big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a hammer made of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kazuto, you can find it using a\Nlightning skill! Lightning? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freya! Chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It flows into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through me, it overflows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friggin' dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's Thor, the god of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You despicable giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your treachery and deceit\Nhas come to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now you shall pay\Nfor stealing Mjolnir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall make you pay for deceiving\Nme, you miserable excuse of a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall rip that beard from your face\Nand send your buddy back to Asgard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thor's pulling aggro from Thrymmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's attack while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, guys! Hit him\Nhard! Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use all your sword skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to your abyss, King of the Diets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Available now. Revel in\Nyour victory, insects!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But take heed if you put your\Nfaith in the dogs of Aesir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude,\Nbrave fairy warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, my treasure has been\Nreturned and my disgrace avenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I must reward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is Mjolnir, the lightning hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it in noble battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my champions.
