Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a legendary weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's a hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't got no hammer skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kazucho?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think this quest is over yet. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good fairies, infiltrate Thrymheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove Excalibur from its\Nplinth and save my realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the medallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all black except\Nfor that one clear spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.51,0:10:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stairway leading down has just\Nappeared behind the throne! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate object!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ID Excalibur!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's breaking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrymheim is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's up to me to save the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for some Olympic grade high jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, how much time we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:12:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can't claim Excalibur\Nunless the quest is cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hop on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish it wasn't so high up. Go on. Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're still too heavy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.59,0:14:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, stupid cardinal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eku, Ski-Ta, Aftal, Eil
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.47,0:15:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C! C! C! C!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C-9!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you,\Nbut with one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you dry, you have\Nto think about me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chick magnet's got another girl's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll think about you every time I try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more than welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only got to do one quest in\Nit, and now it's gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, it's sprouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this great, Tonki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, all your friends have\Ncome to say hi. You see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all waving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a popular guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He removed Excalibur from its plinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The quest has been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the sword which\Nslices wood and iron is secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotunheim can return to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is all thanks to you and your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My younger sisters would also like to\Nexpress their gratitude towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Berdandi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh brave fairy warriors, to think I\Ncan gaze upon a green Jotunheim again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my name is Sculpt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks and respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gift to you shall be the Holy Sword.
