Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally cleared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, Lady Skolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I respect you\Nmore than ever, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can be a dork, but you got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see perfectly, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.87,0:21:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can hear, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, but what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm turning real-time footage\Nof the cafe into mock 3D images.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, try moving, but take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's working right, Huey should\Nfeel like she's flying around the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That camera and its mic are\Nacting like Huey's eyes and ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to you,\Nthat's pretty clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto's taking a class called Mecho...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mecha-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mechatronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I was saying, he's\Ntaking this Mecha-thing class.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to do a project, so\Nwe came up with this idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you ask me, he's\Njust doing it for Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're spoiling me, Daddy!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.97,Reserved,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(559.5,843)\blur0.9\fscx175\fscy175}R{*\c&H17101A&}e{*\c&H19111D&}s{*\c&H1B121F&}e{*\c&H1C1221&}r{*\c&H1E1323&}v{*\c&H201426&}e{\c&H221528&}d \N{\c&H150F18&}f{*\c&H17101A&}o{*\c&H18101C&}r {*\c&H1C1220&}t{*\c&H1D1322&}h{*\c&H1F1424&}e {\c&H221528&}d{*\c&H21142A&}a{*\c&H21142D&}y {\fax-0.33\c&H20132F&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:22:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got the Holy Sword Excalibur\Nand Mjolnir, the lightning hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats to 2025!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was wondering, why did they\Ncall it Excalibur in the game? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,usually in the fantasy\Nbooks and comics I've read,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's always called\NCaliburn, not Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem like someone\Nwho'd be a fan of fantasy books.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was in middle school, I\Npretty much lived at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent all my time there\Nreading books about King Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.25,0:22:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of them referred\Nto it as Caliburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, didn't the sword go by a lot of\Ndifferent names in most of those legends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.23,0:22:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on which Celtic language.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the word caliber is cool because it's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you call the\Ndiameter of a gun barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's also how you describe the\Nquality of a person's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lesson, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.43,0:22:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I got carried away there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically what you're saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever owns Excalibur has to be someone\Nwho's an exceptional person. Huh? Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.15,0:23:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's so exceptional,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't think twice about paying for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dinner with some of that\Ncrazy money he made,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was saving it for a\Nsurprise, but yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dinner's on me.
